# kovanica-mainnet — never commit operator secrets or runtime state.
#
# 1. PoA authority SIGNING keys (operator's 32-byte Ed25519 seed, mode 0600),
#    referenced by the systemd units as `EnvironmentFile=`.
#    `mainnet-authority-keys/authorities.conf` is PUBLIC (64-hex pubkeys +
#    threshold) and IS tracked — it must stay in sync across operators.
mainnet-authority-keys/*.env
authority-keys/*.env

# 2. Runtime state: ledger snapshots, replay logs, peer ban state, operator
#    wallets and validator seeds.
data/
keys/
logs/
seeds/*/data/
seeds/*/keys/
*.log

# 3. Any local env/secret, repo-wide.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# 4. Editor / OS noise.
*.backup
*.bak
*.swp
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
